  "cookies.disableEssential": `Disable Essential Cookies`,
  "cookies.description": `We use first-party Cookies for several reasons. Some Cookies are required for technical reasons in order for our products to operate, and we refer to these as "essential" or "strictly necessary" Cookies.`,
